---
#3959: a shared capability (`given Logger`) of a commons function follows the inclusion
rule of ADR 0726 B: the caller's own `given` must hold it, in a context and in a commons.
---
commons geo.r

consumes bynk { Logger }

fn warn(what: String) -> Effect[()] given Logger {
	Logger.warn(what)
}

fn run() -> Effect[()] {
	warn("x")
}
